{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/x8qh8g26zf",
  "title": "Google Ads 注册流程【英文界面】",
  "author": "袁智翔",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "广告投放",
    "广告",
    "Google Ads"
  ],
  "content": "<ol>\n<li>进入首页 <a href=\"https://ads.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ads.google.com/</a></li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>选择 New Google Ads Account</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>选择创建</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>输入站点信息，然后点击 Next</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li>我们这里只创建账号，不创建广告，所以直接跳过</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"6\">\n<li>继续跳过</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img6.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li>继续跳过</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img7.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"8\">\n<li>选择离开广告创建</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img8.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"9\">\n<li>接下来改一下账单国家和货币，然后 Next</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img9.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"10\">\n<li>接下来要绑定信用卡信息，如果你之前绑定过选择之前的，没绑定的话需要填一下信用卡信息，然后提交</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img10.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img11.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"11\">\n<li>到这一步账号就创建成功了</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img12.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"12\">\n<li>接下来点继续进入控制台</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img13.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img14.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"13\">\n<li>恭喜成功登入</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/x8qh8g26zf_img15.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
